@AlunosService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

GET {{AlunosService_HostAddress}}/api/alunos
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{AlunosService_HostAddress}}/api/alunos?ativo=true
Accept: application/json

###

GET {{AlunosService_HostAddress}}/api/alunos/1
Accept: application/json

###

